<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24074" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιά</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δενν-ιή</span></b>  (fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιός</span>), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>right hand,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστερά</span> (<i>left</i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιῇ ἠσπάζοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.542
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δεξιᾶς</span> on <i>the
				right,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				639
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιᾶς</span> abs.,<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.733
			</span></i>
			<i>A,</i><i><span class="en">
				835
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δεξιῇ ἔχειν τὰ
			οὔρεα</span> keep them on <i>the right</i> (as you go), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.217
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.19
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				98
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δ. λαβεῖν τὴν Σικελίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.1
				</span></i>
			; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐπίδαμνός ἐστι πόλις ἐν δ.
				ἐσπλέοντι . . </span> on <i>your right</i> as you sail in
			. . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορεύεσθαι τὴν εἰς δ.</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδόν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				614c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δεξιᾶ τοῦ βήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.192f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in welcoming
			or saluting (as we shake <i>hands</i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιὰν διδόναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					81
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτείνειν, ἐμβάλλειν,</span>
			etc. (v. sub  vocc.); esp. as a sign of <i>assurance,
				pledge</i> or <i>treaty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπονδαὶ . . καὶ δεξιαὶ ᾗς ἐπέπιθμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.341
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιὰς δόντες καὶ
			λαβόντες</span> having exchanged <i>assurances,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.3.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.1.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιὰς παρὰ βασιλέως φέρειν μὴ
				μνησικακήσειν</span> bring <i>pledges</i> that he would
			not . ., ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.4.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιᾶς πίστις μεγίστη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλάσσειν, τηρεῖν τὴν δ.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				124.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				533.18
			</span></i>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ</span> is never
			expressed in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, but is used later, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρα δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					912
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				1254
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεῦ δ. χείρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					496
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρὸς δ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				899
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χεῖρα δὸς τὴν δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					81
				</span></i>
			.</div>
